---
import SubpageLayout from '../../../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'How do I start the citizenship process in Nauru?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Start with the Government Information Office (GIO) in Yaren. They will confirm the office you need and refer you to the responsible department if a specialist review is needed.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What documents should I bring for citizenship matters?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Bring any identity documents you already have, keep copies of forms and correspondence, and verify office hours before travelling to Yaren (typically Mon–Fri 09:00–16:45).',
      },
    },
  ],
};
---

<SubpageLayout title="Citizenship & Identity" description="Identity, registration and where to start if you need help with a record or document." sectionEmoji="🛂" sectionLabel="Ekauwe" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true} locale="na">
  <Fragment slot="jsonld">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema, null, 2)} />
  </Fragment>
  <p>Use this page when you need a citizen record, identity confirmation or help understanding which office handles your request.</p>
<h2>Checklist</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Confirm the office you need before visiting.</li>
  <li>Bring any identity documents you already have.</li>
  <li>Keep copies of forms and correspondence.</li>
  <li>Verify office hours before travelling to Yaren.</li>
</ul>
<h2>How it works</h2>
<p>Start with the Government Information Office, then follow the referral to the responsible department if a specialist review is needed.</p>
<div class="utility-grid">
  <a href="/na/directory/"><h3>Directory</h3><p>Contact details and offices.</p></a>
  <a href="/na/contact/"><h3>Contact</h3><p>Ask the site team.</p></a>
  <a href="/na/services/immigration/"><h3>Immigration & entry</h3><p>Travel documents and entry.</p></a>
  <a href="/na/news/"><h3>Updates</h3><p>Policy or office changes.</p></a>
</div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{display:grid;gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .utility-card,.callout,.contact-card,.link-grid a{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:18px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;display:block}
  .utility-card h3,.callout h3,.contact-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#002B7F}
  
  @media (max-width: 720px){.utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
